DebugInspector is an independent implementation informed by public behavior and
interaction patterns from these projects:

- Chucker, Apache License 2.0: https://github.com/ChuckerTeam/chucker
- WormaCeptor, Apache License 2.0: https://github.com/azikar24/WormaCeptor
- wiretapKMP, MIT License: https://github.com/skymansandy/wiretapKMP

No source from those projects is copied into this repository without explicit
attribution and license review.

